{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:11:27.383Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## ip/dns **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/dns \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/dns/forwarders **Type:** Directory":"## ip/dns/forwarders \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/dns/static **Type:** Directory":"## ip/dns/static \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/address-list **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/address-list \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/calea **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/calea \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ip/firewall/calea/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/connection **Type:** Directory":"## ip/firewall/connection \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/firewall/connection/tracking **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/firewall/connection/tracking \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000Firewall address lists allow a user to create lists of IP addresses grouped together under a common name. Firewall filter, mangle, and NAT facilities can then use those address lists to match packets against them.":"防火墙地址列表允许用户创建按通用名称分组的 IP 地址列表。随后，防火墙 filter、mangle 和 NAT 功能可以使用这些地址列表来匹配数据包。","docs-7.24\u0000Firewall rules with action `add-src-to-address-list` or `add-dst-to-address-list` work in passthrough mode, which means that the matched packets will be passed to the next firewall rules.":"使用 `add-src-to-address-list` 或 `add-dst-to-address-list` 动作的防火墙规则以 passthrough 模式工作，这意味着匹配的数据包将传递给下一条防火墙规则。","docs-7.24\u0000The address list records can also be updated dynamically via the `action=add-src-to-address-list` or `action=add-dst-to-address-list` items found in NAT, Mangle, and Filter facilities.":"地址列表记录也可以通过 NAT、Mangle 和 Filter 功能中的 `action=add-src-to-address-list` 或 `action=add-dst-to-address-list` 项动态更新。"}}
